 "intro_zh": "林海奇石风景区是一处由人文景观和自然景观构成的生态旅游区和国家地质遗迹公园。景区可分为天然牧场、雪色松林、溪水湿地、民族风情、山水浏览、兴安石林、秋色松林、花卉观赏八大区域。",
 "intro_en": "Jan Lamb Hoi-fong (Chinese: 林海峰; born 28 January 1967) is a Hong Kong DJ, singer and actor. Lamb is the elder brother of Jerry Lamb and younger brother of singer and radio personality Sandy Lamb. He formed a comedic musical duo during the late 1980s with fellow actor and comedian Eric Kot called Softhard). His wife Cass Phang is a singer.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
